namespace Poincare.Longrun.PDE

/-- The ℓ² energy of the explicit heat scheme is nonincreasing in time. -/
theorem HeatGridEvolution.energy_antitone {N : ℕ} {α : ℝ} (ev : HeatGridEvolution N α)
    (hα0 : 0 ≤ α) (hα1 : α ≤ 1 / 2) :
    Antitone fun t : ℕ => energy (ev.u t) N := by
  intro s t hst
  induction t, hst using Nat.le_induction with
  | base => exact le_rfl
  | succ n hmn ih => exact (ev.energy_succ_le hα0 hα1 n).trans ih

end Poincare.Longrun.PDE
```

Wait: `Antitone fun t : ℕ => ...` — the `Antitone` type is `∀ ⦃a b⦄, a ≤ b → f b ≤ f a`. After `intro s t hst`, goal `energy (u t) ≤ energy (u s)`. Induction with `Nat.le_induction` on `t, hst`: motive `fun n _ => energy (ev.u n) N ≤ energy (ev.u s) N`. Base: `n = s`, `hst = le_rfl`, goal `energy (u s) ≤ energy (u s)`; `le_rfl`. Succ: `n` with `hmn : s ≤ n`, `ih : energy (u n) ≤ energy (u s)`, goal `energy (u (n+1)) ≤ energy (u s)`; `(ev.energy_succ_le hα0 hα1 n).trans ih`. Good.

